{"id":"wb-1-74","name":"妙应寺白塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"妙应寺白塔","text":"妙应寺白塔，坐落于中华人民共和国北京市西城区新街口街道阜成门内大街以北的妙应寺内，是一座藏式覆钵式塔，也是中国境内现存年代最早、体积最大的藏式佛塔。该塔始建于元代初年，曾于明、清、民国、中华人民共和国时期多次维修。1961年，妙应寺白塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A6%99%E5%BA%94%E5%AF%BA%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%94","revisionId":91528525,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91528525","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9f36ff360bbb4d15568d3749.jpg","title":"北京妙应寺白塔2021_(3).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%A6%99%E5%BA%94%E5%AF%BA%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%942021_(3).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%A6%99%E5%BA%94%E5%AF%BA%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%942021_%283%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​北京市西城区阜成门内大街171号 妙应寺（白塔寺）","width":320,"height":517}}